DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
31510::$$$message_0246_0000_0000$$$::We meet on the road to the church, as planned.[lr]::
31511::$$$message_0246_0000_0001$$$::Lancer kept his promise.[lr]::
31512::$$$message_0246_0000_0002$$$::"Yo. You're a little early."[lr]::
31513::$$$message_0246_0000_0003$$$::His tone is casual, while his attire is anything but.[lr]::
31514::$$$message_0246_0000_0004$$$::It's been half a year since I've seen him armed for battle.[lr]::
31515::$$$message_0246_0000_0005$$$::...Oh, right.[lr]::
31516::$$$message_0246_0000_0006$$$::It's already been half a year since the war ended.::
31517::$$$message_0246_0001_0000$$$::"So, how's this fight going to go? You said you know the opponent's tactics. Do you have a plan for them?"[lr]::
31518::$$$message_0246_0001_0001$$$::The outcome of this battle depends on whether we can neutralize Fragarach, the trump card of the enemy Master I've yet to meet.[lr]::
31519::$$$message_0246_0001_0002$$$::"No, I can't stop Fragarach. It's a well-made interceptor of a Noble Phantasm. We'll lose if we fight it head-on.[lr]::
31520::$$$message_0246_0001_0003$$$::You can consider Fragarach the ultimate ace in the hole, in a throwdown between trump cards."::
31521::$$$message_0246_0002_0000$$$::Lancer goes on to describe Fragarach.[lr]::
31522::$$$message_0246_0002_0001$$$::He says that there isn't any way to destroy it, that it's a projectile weapon meant to draw the opponent into an all-or-nothing mutual strike, designed to respond to an enemy's trump card the instant they use it.[lr]::
31523::$$$message_0246_0002_0002$$$::So, he won't use a Noble Phantasm to defeat Bazett.[lr]::
31524::$$$message_0246_0002_0003$$$::By sealing his own trump card, he can halve Fragarach's effectiveness.::
31525::$$$message_0246_0003_0000$$$::"That's it?"[lr]::
31526::$$$message_0246_0003_0001$$$::"That's it. Fragarach's just an ordinary Noble Phantasm, as long as I don't use mine. Well, she can use hers as much as she wants, so our fight will be a bit tough."::
31527::$$$message_0246_0004_0000$$$::Lancer's eyes declare that he won't lose, even with the handicap.[lr]::
31528::$$$message_0246_0004_0001$$$::...Come to think of it, most ranged attacks won't work on Lancer, from half-baked spells to throwing knives or arrows.[lr]::
31529::$$$message_0246_0004_0002$$$::His physical abilities as a warrior surpass those of Bazett, so he should be able to beat her in a stand-up fight.[lr]::
31530::$$$message_0246_0004_0003$$$::But...::
31531::$$$message_0246_0005_0000$$$::"I'll use my Noble Phantasm to settle things with her.[lr]::
31532::$$$message_0246_0005_0001$$$::It'll be over in a jiff. You just stand back and watch."[lr]::
31533::$$$message_0246_0005_0002$$$::Fragarach can't be broken.[lr]::
31534::$$$message_0246_0005_0003$$$::Even as Lancer stated that, he declares his intention to face it.::
31535::$$$message_0246_0006_0000$$$::We head up the hill and arrive at a makeshift arena.[lr]::
31536::$$$message_0246_0006_0001$$$::The moonlight is dim. When I look up, my vision becomes slightly muddled.[lr]::
31537::$$$message_0246_0006_0002$$$::Is the moon just dark tonight, or are the stars closer?[lr]::
31538::$$$message_0246_0006_0003$$$::In the dark sky, the murk which feels like I could reach out and grab, two figures await us.::
31539::$$$message_0246_0007_0000$$$::How many times have I seen this kind of sight?[lr]::
31540::$$$message_0246_0007_0001$$$::With the shadowy Avenger at her side, the mage takes in her enemies.[lr]::
31541::$$$message_0246_0007_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
31542::$$$message_0246_0007_0003$$$::Lancer glares at her, as if he's seen a ghost.::
31543::$$$message_0246_0008_0000$$$::He isn't focused on the mage herself, but gauging the distance to the foe with his fingers.[lr]::
31544::$$$message_0246_0008_0001$$$::One, two, three, four.[lr]::
31545::$$$message_0246_0008_0002$$$::They're about ten meters away.[lr]::
31546::$$$message_0246_0008_0003$$$::Lancer walks to an ideal distance for throwing his spear, and points its tip at the ground.::
31547::$$$message_0246_0009_0000$$$::"[argz], [nusz], [ansz], [ingz]."[lr]::
31548::$$$message_0246_0009_0001$$$::Is he casting some kind of spell?[lr]::
31549::$$$message_0246_0009_0002$$$::He's carved runes in four directions, but I don't notice any obvious magecraft at work.[lr]::
31550::$$$message_0246_0009_0003$$$::Without stepping out of the circle he's drawn, he brandishes his spear with a flourish.[lr]::
31551::$$$message_0246_0009_0004$$$::"Come," he gestures.[lr]::
31552::$$$message_0246_0009_0005$$$::Lancer demonstrates his pure will to fight, without wasting time on introductions.::
31553::$$$message_0246_0010_0000$$$::"Avenger. Who is that?"[lr]::
31554::$$$message_0246_0010_0001$$$::Bazett asks the shadow a question.[lr]::
31555::$$$message_0246_0010_0002$$$::"Some kinda Servant. Isn't it obvious?"[wm canskip=0]::
31556::$$$message_0246_0011_0000$$$::"That can't be right. There's never been a Servant like that before.[lr]::
31557::$$$message_0246_0011_0001$$$::Which Servant is that, Avenger?[lr]::
31558::$$$message_0246_0011_0002$$$::He isn't a Saber.[l][say storage=ngh0125_baz_0023 name=バゼット] He isn't an Archer, either. [l][say storage=ngh0125_baz_0024 name=バゼット]Nor a Rider, Caster, or Assassin.[lr]::
31559::$$$message_0246_0011_0003$$$::That's..."[wm canskip=0]::
31560::$$$message_0246_0012_0000$$$::"Like I said, it's obvious.[lr]::
31561::$$$message_0246_0012_0001$$$::Look, Master. Do you really not know anything after seeing our prey?"::
31562::$$$message_0246_0013_0000$$$::The shadow snickers.[lr]::
31563::$$$message_0246_0013_0001$$$::And all at once,[lr]::
31564::$$$message_0246_0013_0002$$$::the mage loses her will to fight.[lr]::
31565::$$$message_0246_0013_0003$$$::She's on the verge of weeping after taking one look at the enemy.[lr]::
31566::$$$message_0246_0013_0004$$$::...Until Lancer's heartless words break the dam on her tears.::
31567::$$$message_0246_0014_0000$$$::"Oi. I'm about to kill you, you know."[lr]::
31568::$$$message_0246_0014_0001$$$::"Eh?"[lr]::
31569::$$$message_0246_0014_0002$$$::She puts up her fists in fright.[lr]::
31570::$$$message_0246_0014_0003$$$::The gesture doesn't have the same steel it did earlier.::
31571::$$$message_0246_0015_0000$$$::"W-wait, please. I...I don't have any reason to fight you.[lr]::
31572::$$$message_0246_0015_0001$$$::You shouldn't have any reason to fight me, either."[lr]::
31573::$$$message_0246_0015_0002$$$::"Sure I do. You're here to win the Holy Grail War.[lr]::
31574::$$$message_0246_0015_0003$$$::The war won't end until all other Servants are defeated.[lr]::
31575::$$$message_0246_0015_0004$$$::Right now, you're here to kill me."::
31576::$$$message_0246_0016_0000$$$::The shadow laughs.[lr]::
31577::$$$message_0246_0016_0001$$$::It's a chuckle of agreement.::
31578::$$$message_0246_0017_0000$$$::"No[line len=2]I...[shock vmax=10 time=300 count=-3]I won't fight you...![lr]::
31579::$$$message_0246_0017_0001$$$::Yeah, I won't. I won't do it, [wvl][shock vmax=10 time=300 count=-3]I'm not going to fight you![lr]::
31580::$$$message_0246_0017_0002$$$::Because, I mean... [cacheimage storage=バゼット02i(遠)][wvl canskip=0 time=600][chgfg textoff=0 pos=c time=300 storage=バゼット02i(遠)]Don't you...[line len=3][wvl canskip=0 time=300]know...me...?"::
31581::$$$message_0246_0018_0000$$$::"I don't have a damn clue who you are. I've never seen such a loser in my life."[lr]::
31582::$$$message_0246_0018_0001$$$::At Lancer's last remark,[lr]::
31583::$$$message_0246_0018_0002$$$::the mage sags like a puppet with its strings cut.[lr]::
31584::$$$message_0246_0018_0003$$$::"...Then, are you my enemy?"[lr]::
31585::$$$message_0246_0018_0004$$$::Before she completely collapses, she forces herself to stay on her feet.::
31586::$$$message_0246_0019_0000$$$::"That's right. Ath nGabla, the Shoal of Four Branches. As a rune user, you know what that means."[lr]::
31587::$$$message_0246_0019_0001$$$::"...Warriors who enter the circle cannot flee.[lr]::
31588::$$$message_0246_0019_0002$$$::And warriors who see the circle cannot retreat.[lr]::
31589::$$$message_0246_0019_0003$$$::...It is a great geas of dueling, passed down to us from the Knights of the Red Branch."::
31590::$$$message_0246_0020_0000$$$::So that's what Lancer's engraving really does.[lr]::
31591::$$$message_0246_0020_0001$$$::The mage regains her warrior's mien, and the spearman takes hold of his weapon with both hands.::
31592::$$$message_0246_0021_0000$$$::...The air freezes.[lr]::
31593::$$$message_0246_0021_0001$$$::Lancer's Noble Phantasm awaits its owner's command.::
31594::$$$message_0246_0022_0000$$$::Ten meters away, the mage stands poised for battle, a lead-colored sphere floating behind her.[lr]::
31595::$$$message_0246_0022_0001$$$::That sphere must be Bazett Fraga McRemitz's greatest secret[line len=2]Fragarach, a magical relic from the Age of Gods.[lr]::
31596::$$$message_0246_0022_0002$$$::Lancer knows its power. He even dubbed it the ultimate interception Mystic Code.::
31597::$$$message_0246_0023_0000$$$::Even knowing that, he still can't hold back against her.[lr]::
31598::$$$message_0246_0023_0001$$$::"Your heart..."[lr]::
31599::$$$message_0246_0023_0002$$$::The spearman tenses his arms.[lr]::
31600::$$$message_0246_0023_0003$$$::He isn't going to throw it. Lancer turns his body itself into a spear.::
31601::$$$message_0246_0024_0000$$$::"...Answerer."[lr]::
31602::$$$message_0246_0024_0001$$$::Bazett deploys the sphere.[lr]::
31603::$$$message_0246_0024_0002$$$::She levels the sword of the gods[line len=2]protected by a curse, a concept[line len=2]at the spearman's heart.[lr]::
31604::$$$message_0246_0024_0003$$$::"...is mine!!!"::
31605::$$$message_0246_0025_0000$$$::Simultaneously, True Names are invoked and weapons are launched.[lr]::
31606::$$$message_0246_0025_0001$$$::First is the cursed crimson spear, Gáe Bolg.[lr]::
31607::$$$message_0246_0025_0002$$$::"You underestimate me, Servant!"[lr]::
31608::$$$message_0246_0025_0003$$$::Fragarach, the Retrograde Sword of Light, intercepts Gáe Bolg.[lr]::
31609::$$$message_0246_0025_0004$$$::There's no such thing as "wait and see" when it comes to Ath nGabla.[lr]::
31610::$$$message_0246_0025_0005$$$::Both fighters move to annihilate each other with their most powerful attacks!::
31611::$$$message_0246_0026_0000$$$::Two points intersect.[lr]::
31612::$$$message_0246_0026_0001$$$::Each attack is meant to slay its target.[lr]::
31613::$$$message_0246_0026_0002$$$::The spearman has no shield to block the sword, and the mage has no way to evade the spear.[lr]::
31614::$$$message_0246_0026_0003$$$::However...if both fighters attack each other at the same time, then the mage won't be hurt.[lr]::
31615::$$$message_0246_0026_0004$$$::Just a sliver.[lr]::
31616::$$$message_0246_0026_0005$$$::As long as the mage's blade strikes home just slightly faster, the duel will end in her favor.::
31617::$$$message_0246_0027_0000$$$::Fragarach, the Retrograde Sword of Light.[lr]::
31618::$$$message_0246_0027_0001$$$::It's not the enemy's heart that it gouges out[line len=2][lr]::
31619::$$$message_0246_0027_0002$$$::it is an arcane blade of absolute victory, which severs the very destiny of two fighters mutually slaying each other.::
31620::$$$message_0246_0028_0000$$$::Due to this Noble Phantasm's unique property, it can never be outpaced.[lr]::
31621::$$$message_0246_0028_0001$$$::The condition to activate Fragarach is the enemy using their trump card.[lr]::
31622::$$$message_0246_0028_0002$$$::The enemy must always act first.[lr]::
31623::$$$message_0246_0028_0003$$$::Thus, the mage will be destroyed by the enemy's Noble Phantasm, even if hers defeats the enemy.[lr]::
31624::$$$message_0246_0028_0004$$$::In truth, this absolutely lethal counterattack is meant to result in the mutual death of both combatants.::
31625::$$$message_0246_0029_0000$$$::However, Bazett's sword overcomes this flaw.[lr]::
31626::$$$message_0246_0029_0001$$$::It activates immediately after the enemy uses their Noble Phantasm, outpacing the enemy no matter how fast they are to strike true and kill them.[lr]::
31627::$$$message_0246_0029_0002$$$::The attack unleashed by this Noble Phantasm converges like a needle point. It is a feat to be admired.[lr]::
31628::$$$message_0246_0029_0003$$$::But what should truly be feared is its trait.[lr]::
31629::$$$message_0246_0029_0004$$$::That Which Launches Second and Strikes First.[lr]::
31630::$$$message_0246_0029_0005$$$::As its title suggests, Fragarach warps causality, overwriting its wielder's attack as having occurred [font italic=true]in advance[font italic=false].::
31631::$$$message_0246_0030_0000$$$::And the outcome...[lr]::
31632::$$$message_0246_0030_0001$$$::...means that no matter how mighty the enemy's Noble Phantasm is, they will never have a chance to use it.[lr]::
31633::$$$message_0246_0030_0002$$$::The defeated has no opportunity to counterattack.[lr]::
31634::$$$message_0246_0030_0003$$$::Fragarach is a Mystic Code which exaggerates this fact.[lr]::
31635::$$$message_0246_0030_0004$$$::It is a conceptual curse which twists destiny itself.::
31636::$$$message_0246_0031_0000$$$::An arcane blade which moves in retrograde to cancel out any attack,[lr]::
31637::$$$message_0246_0031_0001$$$::a trick of the gods using Time itself to neutralize any assault.[lr]::
31638::$$$message_0246_0031_0002$$$::So...[lr]::
31639::$$$message_0246_0031_0003$$$::Lancer is not exempt from its curse, even though he moved first.::
31640::$$$message_0246_0032_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
31641::$$$message_0246_0032_0001$$$::The sword of the war god hurtles across the battlefield.[lr]::
31642::$$$message_0246_0032_0002$$$::There is no way to destroy Fragarach once it has been unleashed.[lr]::
31643::$$$message_0246_0032_0003$$$::Lancer knows full well that he will lose the instant Gáe Bolg and Fragarach meet.::
31644::$$$message_0246_0033_0000$$$::If there's something that wouldn't lose against the sword of the war god, it would be something with multiple lives, or a resurrection Noble Phantasm that activates automatically.[lr]::
31645::$$$message_0246_0033_0001$$$::In fact, the ability to come back to life upon death is the natural counter to Fragarach.[lr]::
31646::$$$message_0246_0033_0002$$$::Of course, Lancer possesses no such Noble Phantasm.[lr]::
31647::$$$message_0246_0033_0003$$$::The spearman engaged in this duel knowing exactly how it would end.::
31648::$$$message_0246_0034_0000$$$::At that time,[lr]::
31649::$$$message_0246_0034_0001$$$::just for a moment, I noticed hesitation in the man in front of me.::
31650::$$$message_0246_0035_0000$$$::"I hate to admit it...[lr]::
31651::$$$message_0246_0035_0001$$$::But we're between a rock and a hard place. I didn't think there would be a time limit."::
31652::$$$message_0246_0036_0000$$$::He wouldn't know what I'm referring to.[lr]::
31653::$$$message_0246_0036_0001$$$::But,[lr]::
31654::$$$message_0246_0036_0002$$$::"I'm counting on you. At this rate, there's going to be another boring ending.[lr]::
31655::$$$message_0246_0036_0003$$$::I don't want her to be that way."[lr]::
31656::$$$message_0246_0036_0004$$$::His grumbling sounds familiar.::
31657::$$$message_0246_0037_0000$$$::It happened a long time ago.[lr]::
31658::$$$message_0246_0037_0001$$$::"[line len=3]Perhaps I wanted you to kill me.[line len=3]"[lr]::
31659::$$$message_0246_0037_0002$$$::With a gentle voice, the witch of the Land of Shadows smiled like she was praying.::
31660::$$$message_0246_0038_0000$$$::...Strangely, this was when she gave him the demonic spear.[lr]::
31661::$$$message_0246_0038_0001$$$::The witch was no longer human.[lr]::
31662::$$$message_0246_0038_0002$$$::She had slain far too many men, gods, and wraiths with her sublime martial arts and magical prowess.[lr]::
31663::$$$message_0246_0038_0003$$$::She was the only mentor Culann's guard dog ever followed, and she was relegated to a deathless fate.[lr]::
31664::$$$message_0246_0038_0004$$$::Her domain would eventually be cut off from the material world, transforming into a land of the dead.[lr]::
31665::$$$message_0246_0038_0005$$$::The reward for a human who grew too close to the gods was exile/promotion to a place neither material nor spectral.::
31666::$$$message_0246_0039_0000$$$::"Oh, dear. I should have died before I got to this state."[lr]::
31667::$$$message_0246_0039_0001$$$::In the gloomy castle garden, the witch laughed.[lr]::
31668::$$$message_0246_0039_0002$$$::He loved her hearty laugh.[lr]::
31669::$$$message_0246_0039_0003$$$::Still a boy, her beloved pupil arrived at her castle by the shortest route.[lr]::
31670::$$$message_0246_0039_0004$$$::And yet...::
31671::$$$message_0246_0040_0000$$$::"If only you had been born a little sooner. Ah, youth."[lr]::
31672::$$$message_0246_0040_0001$$$::The witch chuckled.[lr]::
31673::$$$message_0246_0040_0002$$$::She accepted her pupil as a first-rate warrior.[lr]::
31674::$$$message_0246_0040_0003$$$::"Sorry."[lr]::
31675::$$$message_0246_0040_0004$$$::In his own way, he had intended to live life in a hurry, but...[lr]::
31676::$$$message_0246_0040_0005$$$::"Looks like I got a bit distracted."[lr]::
31677::$$$message_0246_0040_0006$$$::...He left regret with the woman he loved.::
31678::$$$message_0246_0041_0000$$$::The sword of the war god pierces Lancer through the chest.[lr]::
31679::$$$message_0246_0041_0001$$$::"Hrngh!"[lr]::
31680::$$$message_0246_0041_0002$$$::Briefly forgotten, intense pain comes to the fore.[lr]::
31681::$$$message_0246_0041_0003$$$::He puts strength into his crumbling fingers.[lr]::
31682::$$$message_0246_0041_0004$$$::...There's still one regret left in this spear.[lr]::
31683::$$$message_0246_0041_0005$$$::It's a cursed spear that's only killed those he loves.[lr]::
31684::$$$message_0246_0041_0006$$$::His one and only best friend. His son who grew up in a distant land.[lr]::
31685::$$$message_0246_0041_0007$$$::But before them, it was supposed to kill a woman.::
31686::$$$message_0246_0042_0000$$$::Now that he considers it, his life has been full of detours.[lr]::
31687::$$$message_0246_0042_0001$$$::No one can replace anyone else, but if there's anyone who can be saved, he'll clear up the regret of his youth right now.[lr]::
31688::$$$message_0246_0042_0002$$$::Lancer's lips curl into a cold, determined smile.[lr]::
31689::$$$message_0246_0042_0003$$$::He grits his teeth as his heart is gouged out,[lr]::
31690::$$$message_0246_0042_0004$$$::"Gotta ask, though... Why am I never involved with any of the good women?"[lr]::
31691::$$$message_0246_0042_0005$$$::He laments his karmic bonds, far too late.::
31692::$$$message_0246_0043_0000$$$::"I've got him...!"[lr]::
31693::$$$message_0246_0043_0001$$$::And thus the mage is sure of her victory.[lr]::
31694::$$$message_0246_0043_0002$$$::Her war god's sword outspeeds the enemy's spear and strikes home.[lr]::
31695::$$$message_0246_0043_0003$$$::In that moment, the enemy's attack was reversed, becoming an event that never occurs.[lr]::
31696::$$$message_0246_0043_0004$$$::That's the principle of this world.[lr]::
31697::$$$message_0246_0043_0005$$$::A conclusion that preserves the absolute order known as Time.::
31698::$$$message_0246_0044_0000$$$::"...Eh?"[lr]::
31699::$$$message_0246_0044_0001$$$::But know this, she who would wind back Order.[lr]::
31700::$$$message_0246_0044_0002$$$::Concepts are destroyed by concepts.[lr]::
31701::$$$message_0246_0044_0003$$$::The spearman too bears a temporal curse.::
31702::$$$message_0246_0045_0000$$$::"......"[lr]::
31703::$$$message_0246_0045_0001$$$::She ruptures.[lr]::
31704::$$$message_0246_0045_0002$$$::The barb slipped into her ribcage as fast as lightning, and the instant it struck her heart, it turned into a thousand thorns, annihilating the mage's body from within.::
31705::$$$message_0246_0046_0000$$$::"Argh... This...spear..."[lr]::
31706::$$$message_0246_0046_0001$$$::She ruptures.[lr]::
31707::$$$message_0246_0046_0002$$$::Pain and astonishment causes her sealed memories to burst out like water out of a broken dam.::
31708::$$$message_0246_0047_0000$$$::While Fragarach's curse switches the sequence of events, Lancer's cursed spear reverses causality itself.[lr]::
31709::$$$message_0246_0047_0001$$$::As soon as its True Name was invoked, Gáe Bolg possessed the outcome that it had already struck the target's heart.[lr]::
31710::$$$message_0246_0047_0002$$$::Thus, it is futile to return to the moment before it was activated and kill its owner.[lr]::
31711::$$$message_0246_0047_0003$$$::The spear which carries the outcome of piercing a heart will relentlessly carry out its duty, even if its wielder is deceased.::
31712::$$$message_0246_0048_0000$$$::...Oh, that's right.[lr]::
31713::$$$message_0246_0048_0001$$$::Because she's now on the verge of death, her brain still can't process who her enemy is...[lr]::
31714::$$$message_0246_0048_0002$$$::...but this is a clash of rules.[lr]::
31715::$$$message_0246_0048_0003$$$::This person is the only man in the world who can return things to their proper order.::
31716::$$$message_0246_0049_0000$$$::"I never...said my farewells."[lr]::
31717::$$$message_0246_0049_0001$$$::Before she knows it, the spearman is in front of her.[lr]::
31718::$$$message_0246_0049_0002$$$::He's a little far away. [l]She tries to reach out to him, but he's just barely out of reach.::
31719::$$$message_0246_0050_0000$$$::"...You forgot this. I'm giving it back."[lr]::
31720::$$$message_0246_0050_0001$$$::He pulls out the spear.[lr]::
31721::$$$message_0246_0050_0002$$$::With a clang, something hard falls on the ground.[lr]::
31722::$$$message_0246_0050_0003$$$::The mage's body collapses with nothing to support it.::
31723::$$$message_0246_0051_0000$$$::She sinks into a pool of her own blood.[lr]::
31724::$$$message_0246_0051_0001$$$::With dying eyes, she sees...[lr]::
31725::$$$message_0246_0051_0002$$$::"...Ah."[lr]::
31726::$$$message_0246_0051_0003$$$::A crystal earring on the ground.[lr]::
31727::$$$message_0246_0051_0004$$$::She remembers.[lr]::
31728::$$$message_0246_0051_0005$$$::She remembers, so she reaches for it and clutches it in her hand.[lr]::
31729::$$$message_0246_0051_0006$$$::It costs her half of her dwindling life force to do it, but she's happy at the stone's touch.::
31730::$$$message_0246_0052_0000$$$::"I know this. It's..."[lr]::
31731::$$$message_0246_0052_0001$$$::She reaches for her pocket,[lr]::
31732::$$$message_0246_0052_0002$$$::but her arm can't move anymore, so she can't take out the lucky charm she was keeping inside.::
31733::$$$message_0246_0053_0000$$$::"Ah... Hey, wait.[lr]::
31734::$$$message_0246_0053_0001$$$::I... I have one of these."[lr]::
31735::$$$message_0246_0053_0002$$$::Even she doesn't know what she's trying to say.[lr]::
31736::$$$message_0246_0053_0003$$$::But she feels terribly, terribly sad that she can't show him what's in her pocket. So sad that she doesn't even know what it is anymore.::
31737::$$$message_0246_0054_0000$$$::The spearman leaves.[lr]::
31738::$$$message_0246_0054_0001$$$::The mage's eyes waver between melancholy and joy.[lr]::
31739::$$$message_0246_0054_0002$$$::"Wait... I have...I have it... [noise monocro=0 type=ltDodge opacity=168]I have it... [stopnoise]I..."[lr]::
31740::$$$message_0246_0054_0003$$$::Her voice dies off ten seconds later.[lr]::
31741::$$$message_0246_0054_0004$$$::All in all, it took a minute.[lr]::
31742::$$$message_0246_0054_0005$$$::The spearman's prediction was painfully accurate.::
31743::$$$message_0246_0055_0000$$$::"Argh. That wasn't worth it."[lr]::
31744::$$$message_0246_0055_0001$$$::Lancer steps away from Bazett's corpse and sighs heavily.[lr]::
31745::$$$message_0246_0055_0002$$$::He leans on his spear like a cane, supporting his bloody form.::
31746::$$$message_0246_0056_0000$$$::"......"[lr]::
31747::$$$message_0246_0056_0001$$$::...In any case, the battle is won.[lr]::
31748::$$$message_0246_0056_0002$$$::Only Bazett's Servant, Avenger, remains.[lr]::
31749::$$$message_0246_0056_0003$$$::Now that he's lost his Master, he probably isn't very strong.::
31750::$$$message_0246_0057_0000$$$::"Well done.[lr]::
31751::$$$message_0246_0057_0001$$$::Got any of that fighting spirit left for me, Lancer?"[lr]::
31752::$$$message_0246_0057_0002$$$::"I sure do... Or so I'd like to say, but, well...[lr]::
31753::$$$message_0246_0057_0003$$$::Looks like I've got problems of my own."::
31754::$$$message_0246_0058_0000$$$::Lancer's body is fading.[lr]::
31755::$$$message_0246_0058_0001$$$::The duel between Fragarach and Gáe Bolg resulted in a mutual kill.[lr]::
31756::$$$message_0246_0058_0002$$$::Each fighter took the brunt of the other's Noble Phantasm. Lancer isn't walking away from this.::
31757::$$$message_0246_0059_0000$$$::"Sorry. You go on and do what you want.[lr]::
31758::$$$message_0246_0059_0001$$$::My job here is done anyway, isn't it, kid?"[lr]::
31759::$$$message_0246_0059_0002$$$::Perhaps one could call it a graceful exit.[lr]::
31760::$$$message_0246_0059_0003$$$::With a parting mutter about not looking very dashing, he casually departs the world.::
31761::$$$message_0246_0060_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
31762::$$$message_0246_0060_0001$$$::...But what happens now?[lr]::
31763::$$$message_0246_0060_0002$$$::We defeated Bazett, who we believed to have recreated the Holy Grail War.[lr]::
31764::$$$message_0246_0060_0003$$$::Nothing dramatic has happened yet, but once dawn comes, we should be free from the chains of the fourth day[line len=2]::
31765::$$$message_0246_0061_0000$$$::"As if. The Holy Grail War won't end just because you killed Bazett. Besides, she'll come back to life as long as I'm still around."[lr]::
31766::$$$message_0246_0061_0001$$$::The shadow laughs.[lr]::
31767::$$$message_0246_0061_0002$$$::Avenger still exists without any obvious penalty, even though his Master is dead.::
31768::$$$message_0246_0062_0000$$$::"You..."[lr]::
31769::$$$message_0246_0062_0001$$$::"Hold on, don't get so worked up.[lr]::
31770::$$$message_0246_0062_0002$$$::You did kill Bazett, after all. There's a big show in store for you."[lr]::
31771::$$$message_0246_0062_0003$$$::"...!"::
31772::$$$message_0246_0063_0000$$$::The moon is dyed.[lr]::
31773::$$$message_0246_0063_0001$$$::Before I know it, the church is surrounded by those monsters.::
31774::$$$message_0246_0064_0000$$$::                                             "FAIled fAIlEd failed!"[rf]::
31775::$$$message_0246_0065_0000$$$::"Rrgh...[wvl canskip=0 time=800] Wait, what the...[lr]::
31776::$$$message_0246_0065_0001$$$::Do these things not want to fight...?"[lr]::
31777::$$$message_0246_0065_0002$$$::The monsters don't so much as twitch.[lr]::
31778::$$$message_0246_0065_0003$$$::Their bright, smoldering eyes stare not just at me, but the Servant.[lr]::
31779::$$$message_0246_0065_0004$$$::...They cackle in delight at others' failures.::
31780::$$$message_0246_0066_0000$$$::                                       "yEs, YES, yOu FailED agAIn!"[rf]::
31781::$$$message_0246_0067_0000$$$::"...Dammit. They think I'm one of them now that I've lost my Master."[lr]::
31782::$$$message_0246_0067_0001$$$::His voice is like that of a condemned criminal afraid of death.[lr]::
31783::$$$message_0246_0067_0002$$$::Like he doesn't want to be next on the chopping block.[lr]::
31784::$$$message_0246_0067_0003$$$::The Servant earnestly looks to me for help, and...[lr]::
31785::$$$message_0246_0067_0004$$$::...morphs into a twisted monstrosity.::
31786::$$$message_0246_0068_0000$$$::                                                  "Yes yEs yEs!"[rf]::
31787::$$$message_0246_0069_0000$$$::"What...the hell are you!?"[lr]::
31788::$$$message_0246_0069_0001$$$::He's just like them.[lr]::
31789::$$$message_0246_0069_0002$$$::The Servant called Avenger completely melts, turning into something like the monsters.::
31790::$$$message_0246_0070_0000$$$::"And now, I fail.[lr]::
31791::$$$message_0246_0070_0001$$$::Take a good look, Shirou Emiya. This is my true from. I fail endlessly. I keep dying endlessly.[lr]::
31792::$$$message_0246_0070_0002$$$::As long as I'm around, the Holy Grail War will never end."::
31793::$$$message_0246_0071_0000$$$::                                   "YOU tOO, yOu TOO, You ToO...!"[rf]::
31794::$$$message_0246_0072_0000$$$::He shivers, his teeth chattering.[lr]::
31795::$$$message_0246_0072_0001$$$::The thing that used to be Avenger bleeds from all over its body, cowering in fear of the monsters around it. Yet, it continues to shout, its sanity intact.::
31796::$$$message_0246_0073_0000$$$::"liStEn. reAch hEavEn'S fEEL. haH, KeE, haRGh, GERGH, bury the void. STOP. Fill the Holy Grail. STOP IT STOP IT. Massacre all possibilities. STOP IT STOP IT STOP IT, i CaN'T See I cAn't seE i can'T see anytHInG...! tHAt's RiGHt, come kill me, the real monster, STOP IT STOP IT, STaY away, IF YoU Come TO KiLL Me I'lL kiLl you...!!!"::
31797::$$$message_0246_0074_0000$$$::...The monsters consume the dark shadow.[lr]::
31798::$$$message_0246_0074_0001$$$::It doesn't take them much time to finish the ritual.[lr]::
31799::$$$message_0246_0074_0002$$$::One by one, the monsters disappear, leaving a new,[lr]::
31800::$$$message_0246_0074_0003$$$::mindless, repulsive beast squatting in their wake.::
31801::$$$message_0246_0075_0000$$$::"                            "[lr]::
31802::$$$message_0246_0075_0001$$$::Our eyes meet.[lr]::
31803::$$$message_0246_0075_0002$$$::The monster cocks its head quizzically, then bounds into the grass like a frog.::
31804::$$$message_0246_0076_0000$$$::"......"[lr]::
31805::$$$message_0246_0076_0001$$$::...I'm left alone in the clearing.[lr]::
31806::$$$message_0246_0076_0002$$$::There isn't a trace of Bazett's body. I'm probably back at the first day.::
31807::$$$message_0246_0077_0000$$$::"...Heaven's...Feel...?"[lr]::
31808::$$$message_0246_0077_0001$$$::I've heard that somewhere before.[lr]::
31809::$$$message_0246_0077_0002$$$::Heaven's Feel. In the Holy Grail War half a year ago, there was a girl who went by that title.[lr]::
31810::$$$message_0246_0077_0003$$$::...That's all I can remember now.[lr]::
31811::$$$message_0246_0077_0004$$$::Dawn breaks, bringing an end to the day.[lr]::
31812::$$$message_0246_0077_0005$$$::The final path is shown to me, in the winter castle where the girl waits...::
931704::$$$message_9246_0045_0002$$$::The barb slipped into her ribcage as fast as lightning, and the instant it struck her heart, it turned into a thousand thorns, annihilating the mage's body from within.::

